# Beszel hub environment - rendered by opslayer monitor deploy.
# The hub embeds PocketBase and writes its data directory (beszel_data/) under
# WorkingDirectory (/opt/beszel/hub), which deploy chowns to user beszel.
# On a FRESH hub, deploy appends USER_EMAIL/USER_PASSWORD here so the first
# admin is created on start with no browser step; on an existing hub those are
# ignored and opslayer authenticates with the credentials in the operator .env.
# `opslayer monitor beszel-init` prompts for the creds, stores them in .env, and
# then mints a permanent universal token + reads the hub key to wire the agent.